Dearest Family Member ❤️,

As most of you know, I have moved away from Instagram. So this is my way of sharing the highlights with all of you ❤️ - a modern take on newsletters.

## The Lore ⚔️

### What, How & Why?

On the most random day possible - me and Rohit get on a call. We talk about potential summer plans - I mention a trip to Turkey or Greece, nothing concrete . Rohit then drops the C word. Canada Road Trip! A 4 - 5 week cross-country trip to give self-realisation in cities/towns with no SY collectives. A cross-country with purpose.

I was immediately sold on the idea! Ever since I went to the DEVI School, cross-country Canada has been a lifelong dream for me.

The goal of the trip was to do a bunch of Public Programs - spread Love and Compassion to all

### Looking back at everything.

Tears of joy shower down as I look back at all these incredible moments of the trip! Canada, I will be back 🇨🇦.

Special Thank You to the legendary Rohit ✨,

Everything was possible because of Rohit! All the driving (yes, ALL OF IT) - all the public programs! Everything!

If you are reading this, know that I appreciate you so much - let me know if you enjoy this type of format / sharing thing (maybe you can suggest a name).

And just like that - this adventure also comes to an end.

Thank you ❤️

PS. This is just a stream of consciousness - no double-checking my spelling or grammar - I hope no ones get triggered.

